    "standardized_narrative": "The Syndicate's gross outstanding claims at 1 January 2019 were GBP 54.033m. During 2019 there was a small favourable prior-year development, reducing gross claims outstanding by GBP 1.196m (a c.2.2% release), recorded in the technical reserves movement note. The report attributes historical reserve movements to developments on prior catastrophe-affected years (notably 2017 and 2018) where a series of hurricanes, earthquakes and wildfires influenced claims; the 2019 movement was modest and recorded as favourable development across the portfolio.",
